# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Hammertoe's Digsite

step Hammertoe's Digsite
  zone Badlands
  tip Head back west to the road and follow it south out of Loch Modan through the pass into the Badlands. Prospector Ryedol and Sigrun Ironhew camp side by side at the dig.
  accept 719                          -- Prospector Ryedol
  accept 718                          -- Sigrun Ironhew

step Hammertoe's Digsite: kill these as you meet them
  zone Badlands
  tip The Shadowforge dwarves camp just north of the digsite; the crumpled map lies among their tents. Tunnelers and Darkweavers carry Ryedol's pick. Crag Coyotes roam the slopes around it.
  accept 720                          -- Crumpled Map
  collect 7846 quest 2500             -- Crag Coyote Fang
  collect 4616 quest 719              -- Ryedol's Lucky Pick
  collect 7847 quest 2500             -- Buzzard Gizzard

step The excavation crate
  tip Head north-east to the abandoned dig; the supply crate lies there among the Dustbelcher ogres.
  collect 4629 quest 718              -- Supply Crate

step Hammertoe's Digsite
  note Ryedol's next errand goes into Uldaman: skip it.
  turnin 718                          -- Sigrun Ironhew
  accept 733
  turnin 720
  turnin 719                          -- Prospector Ryedol

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The middle

step Valley of Fangs
  tip Martek and Rigglefuzz camp together in the Valley of Fangs, in the middle of the Badlands.
  turnin 1106                         -- Martek the Exiled
  accept 1108
  accept 703                          -- Rigglefuzz
  accept 705                          -- The clams lie on Stranglethorn's north-west coast, in the next guide: keep it

step Agmond's End
  tip The battered skeleton lies just east of the ogres, at the edge of the Stonevault trogg camp; the Bonesnappers and Shamans around it drop the flakes. Theldurin sits by the ruined camp further south.
  turnin 738                          -- Battered Dwarven Skeleton

step Agmond's End: kill these as you meet them
  zone Badlands
  tip The Dustbelcher ogres camp just south of the valley; any of them drops scrap. Buzzards circle the plain to the east.
  tip The battered skeleton lies at the edge of the Stonevault trogg camp; Murdaloc, Agmond's killer, walks among the Bonesnappers.
  tip Careful: Dustbelcher Lords are level 44-45. They use Battle Shout and Demoralizing Shout, and below 50% health they call for help from allies within 15 yd. Seven of them stand about 750 yd south of Kargath.
  collect 4630 quest 733              -- Scrap Metal
  collect 3404 quest 703              -- Buzzard Wing
  collect 7847 quest 2500             -- Buzzard Gizzard
  accept 739                          -- Battered Dwarven Skeleton
  note Murdaloc himself (42) walks among the Bonesnappers: leave him for the later Badlands guide at 43, and kill the Bonesnappers for this quest now.
  collect 5797 quest 1108             -- Indurium Flake
  kill 2893 quest 739                 -- Stonevault Bonesnapper
  accept 709                          -- Theldurin the Lost

step Lotwil Veriatus
  tip Head west into the Dustbowl; Lotwil works by his machines in the middle of it.
  accept 710

step Lesser Rock Elementals
  tip The Lesser Rock Elementals wander the Dustbowl west of Lotwil; every rock elemental can drop Ghak's Rock Elemental Shards.
  collect 4626 quest 710              -- Small Stone Shard
  collect 7848 quest 2500             -- Rock Elemental Shard

step Lotwil Veriatus
  turnin 710
  accept 711

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The north

step The Ancient Chest
  tip Head north-east to the dwarven ruins in the north of the Badlands; the chest sits among the Shadowforge dwarves. Ambassador Infernus nearby is elite: give him room.
  collect 4631 quest 709              -- Tablet of Ryun'eh; below ground

step Valley of Fangs
  tip Head south down the road: Martek and Rigglefuzz camp in the Valley of Fangs, on the way to Agmond's End.
  turnin 1108                         -- Martek the Exiled
  accept 1137                         -- For Fizzle Brassbolts at the Mirage Raceway: the Tanaris guide passes him at 45, keep it
  turnin 703                          -- Rigglefuzz

step Theldurin the Lost
  tip Head south to Agmond's End.
  turnin 709
  accept 727                          -- for Gerrig Bonegrip in Ironforge: keep it

step Rock Elementals
  tip The Rock Elementals roam south-east of Lotwil; Giant Buzzards and Elder Crag Coyotes share the plain to their west.
  collect 4627 quest 711              -- Large Stone Slab

step Lotwil Veriatus
  tip Lotwil's last test is optional: five Bracers of Rock Binding, which only the Greater Rock Elementals (42-44) in the south-western gulches drop, about one kill in five, well above your level. Take it only if you can handle them one at a time; otherwise hand in the slabs and move on.
  turnin 711
  accept 712 optional

step Bracers of Rock Binding
  when onquest 712
  tip South-west into the gulches: only the Greater Rock Elementals there drop the bracers.
  collect 4628 quest 712              -- Bracers of Rock Binding

step Lotwil Veriatus
  when complete 712
  turnin 712

